#: build/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:136 build/blocks/membership-fees/render.php:36 src/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:136 src/blocks/membership-fees/render.php:36 build/blocks/membership-fees/index.js:3 src/blocks/membership-fees/index.js:113
msgid "Share of hours"
msgstr "Andel av timmarna"

#. translators: 1: sum of the unreduced fees, 2: expected total, 3: amount
#. taken off each fee.
#: build/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:123 src/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:123
msgid "The unreduced fees add up to %1$s, more than the expected total of %2$s. The difference is shared equally: each fee is lowered by %3$s, so all fees together give the expected total. No fee goes below zero; if one would, that member pays nothing and the rest is shared by the members who volunteered."
msgstr "De oreducerade avgifterna blir tillsammans %1$s, mer än den förväntade totalsumman på %2$s. Skillnaden fördelas lika: varje avgift sänks med %3$s, så att alla avgifter tillsammans ger den förväntade totalsumman. Ingen avgift går under noll; om det skulle hända betalar den medlemmen ingenting och resten fördelas på de medlemmar som har gjort ideella timmar."

#. translators: %s: hours of all regular members.
#: build/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:116 src/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:116
msgid "Each regular member’s share of the hours of all regular members (%s hours) lowers the unreduced fee: unreduced fee = expected total × (1 − share of hours)."
msgstr "Varje ordinarie medlems andel av alla ordinarie medlemmars timmar (%s timmar) sänker den oreducerade avgiften: oreducerad avgift = förväntad totalsumma × (1 − andel av timmarna)."

#: build/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:111 src/blocks/fee-explanation/render.php:111
msgid "3. Fee of each member"
msgstr "3. Varje medlems avgift"

